    {
      "id": "chain",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 資料生命週期\n\nRaw Event → Acquisition Time → Snapshot → Data Layer → Phone Persist → Freshness → Quality → Calibration → Acceptance → Health Connect → UI\n\n**Raw ≠ Calibrated · Export ≠ Health Connect · Export ≠ UI**\n\n拒絕原因：no sensor / registration failed / no event / condition unmet / stale / transport rejected / quality rejected / raw unscaled / persistence failed / not rendered",
      "x": 400,
      "y": -280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "team1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# PM 與裝置／QA\n\n**Lorentz** — PM、驗收順序\n**Harvey** — Wear LOW_MEMORY／資源\n**Maxwell** — 測試矩陣\n**Gödel** — Release／簽章／版本\n**Archimedes** — Android 官方文件\n\n輸出：版本配對、終態、逐通道證據、真機複測。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": -280,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "team2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 資料與使用者通知\n\n**Heisenberg** — Data Layer／持久化／拒收分類\n**Feynman** — Health Connect／UI 數值一致\n**Arendt** — 通知與耗電路徑\n\n輸出：received ≠ persisted、細分 rejection、核對本地日彙總、只量實際推播。",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "team3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 感測與醫療安全\n\n**Descartes** — sensor family／晶片文件／論文\n**Kant** — 演算法假設／醫療安全\n\n輸出：待證晶片映射不冒充 BOM；把研究估算與校準臨床輸出分開。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 目前 Gate：BLOCK\n\n- 手錶無線 ADB 已離線，無法從 Wear UI 重跑\n- Phone/Wear 版號需配對\n- 真機重複掃描尚未完成\n- LOW_MEMORY 根因未歸屬\n- 校準缺失的 raw data 不轉成醫療值\n\n**下一步**：重新連線 → UI 單輪 → 對 session 作端到端核對 → 修一項 → 定向回歸。",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "1"
    },
